[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0001","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0010","text":"两个人都练得很有感觉了！\n那今天就到这里。辛苦了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0020","text":"────辛苦了／────好的，辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0030","text":"那个，美琴小姐……\n还有时间的话……您会留下来练吧？自主练习"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0040","text":"嗯，是打算练一会儿\n在那之前，我去买点喝的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0050","text":"啊，好的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0060","text":"（───美琴小姐的舞蹈……\n　连指尖，每一处……都好美……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0070","text":"────大概是这样吧……\n………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0080","text":"……我在干什么啊\n明明不可能做到的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0090","text":"────怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0100","text":"啊，没有……完全没那回事……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0110","text":"是吗\n那，开始吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32400100_04_0111","text":"Motion"}]
